# https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/delegatedTo node786
node786 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>delegatedTo</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/delegatedTo' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/delegatedTo</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;The `from` Agent is delegating an action to the Agent of the `to` Relationship (which shall be of type invokedBy), during a LifecycleScopeType (e.g. the `to` invokedBy Relationship is being done on behalf of `from`).&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
